      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091412">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091414">SSE2</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091416">Return the bitwise logical OR of packed double precision floating-point values in xmm1 and xmm2/mem. </para>
      </td>
